# Constraints for every package Music Assistant installs into its venv
# (UV_CONSTRAINT, set by ma-install and S98music-assistant).
#
# numpy 2.4+ wheels need x86-64-v2 (SSE4.2/POPCNT): SIGILL on the EA's Atom.
numpy<2.4
# Smart Fades and Sonic Analysis need torch, which from PyPI drags in ~4 GB of
# CUDA and fills the eMMC partway through. Unsatisfiable, so adding one of
# those providers fails at once instead.
torch<0
